*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]  verification of 5GC002255-EA feature in the case of FDD+TDD Classical Fullstack SA
...               Prerequisite : GNB and Airphone should be installed
...               Scope : With configuration allowing interband CA, perform call and check that
...               Scell Good and Bad RLQ mechanisms work as expected
